#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:38
#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:583
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:40
msgid ""
"Your Morpheus appliance **must have a valid, signed SSL certificate** "
"configured for external MCP clients to connect. Self-signed or untrusted "
"certificates will cause TLS verification failures in MCP clients (Claude "
"Desktop, VS Code, etc.) that cannot be easily bypassed. See :ref:`SSL "
"Certificates` for configuration details."
msgstr ""
"Su appliance de Morpheus **debe tener un certificado SSL válido y firmado** "
"configurado para que los clientes MCP externos puedan conectarse. Los "
"certificados autofirmados o no confiables causarán fallos de verificación "
"TLS en los clientes MCP (Claude Desktop, VS Code, etc.) que no se pueden "
"eludir fácilmente. Consulte :ref:`SSL Certificates` para detalles de "
"configuración."

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:43
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autenticación"

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:45
msgid ""
"External clients authenticate using the same mechanisms as the Morpheus "
"REST API:"
msgstr ""
"Los clientes externos se autentican utilizando los mismos mecanismos que "
"la API REST de Morpheus:"

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Bearer Token** — ``Authorization: Bearer <your-api-token>`` header "
"(recommended)"
msgstr ""
"**Bearer Token** — encabezado ``Authorization: Bearer <your-api-token>`` "
"(recomendado)"

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:48
msgid "**Access Token** — ``?access_token=<token>`` query parameter"
msgstr "**Access Token** — parámetro de consulta ``?access_token=<token>``"

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Execution Token** — ``Authorization: Execution <token>`` header (for "
"task/job contexts)"
msgstr ""
"**Execution Token** — encabezado ``Authorization: Execution <token>`` "
"(para contextos de tareas/trabajos)"

#: ../../tools/ai/morpheus_mcp_server.rst:51
msgid ""
"All tool executions enforce the authenticated user's role permissions. A "
"user can only access tools and resources their Morpheus role allows."
msgstr ""
"Todas las ejecuciones de herramientas aplican los permisos de rol del "
"usuario autenticado. Un usuario solo puede acceder a las herramientas y "
"recursos que su rol de Morpheus permita."

